## Project Context

- **Mod**: Nourished — NeoForge 1.21.1 nutrition system mod
- **Language**: Java 21
- **Package root**: `dev.maire.nourished`
- **Build**: Gradle with NeoForge ModDev plugin
- **Config**: Cloth Config
- **Changelog**: Auto-generated by git-cliff from commit messages — commit quality = changelog quality

## Architecture Reminders

- Food classification is **tag-driven** — items go in `data/nourished/tags/item/nutrients/<category>.json`
- Network uses **two payloads**: `SyncDietPayload` (full, login only) and `SyncDietDeltaPayload` (lightweight, every eat/decay)
- Memory maps **never cross the network** — server-side only
- `UnassignedFoodScanner` is a **dev tool only** — never ships in release jar
- Compat is **three-tier**: built-in → mod-provided `nourished_compat.json` → modpack `compat_overrides.json`
